# scratch-devdocs/ stays gitignored (AGENTS.md). The architecture artifacts
# (devdocs/architecture/{crate-graph.json,DEPENDENCIES.md}) are also generated
# by `cargo xtask arch gen`, but they are INTENTIONALLY TRACKED: `arch check`
# drift-diffs the on-disk copy, so they must stay in git. Everything below
# this line is regenerable build/test output — never track it.

scratch-devdocs/

# Build output (workspace + fuzz workspace).
/target
/fuzz/target/
/fuzz/artifacts/
/fuzz/coverage/

# Fuzz corpora grow to hundreds of MB from fuzzing runs; regenerate by running
# the targets (`just fuzz-smoke` / `cargo +nightly fuzz run <target>`). Seed
# files may be force-added deliberately (`git add -f`) if a reproducer must be
# shared; the fuzz-smoke recipes pick up force-added seeds via git ls-files.
/fuzz/corpus/

# The fuzz workspace lockfile is regenerated by `cargo +nightly fuzz run`;
# it is dev-only and excluded from the workspace build, so it is not tracked.
# cargo-fuzz also regenerates fuzz/.gitignore on init; root rules cover it.
/fuzz/Cargo.lock
/fuzz/.gitignore

# Coverage and profiling intermediates.
*.profraw
*.profdata

# OS / editor cruft.
.zcode
.claude
.codex
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
